<title>USA: Corporacion Andina sells $200 in two-part deal.</title>
<headline>Corporacion Andina sells $200 in two-part deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche debt deal from Corporacion Andina de Fomento was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER CORPORACION ANDINA DE FOMENTO</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.25 PCT   MATURITY 3/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE  NOTES	  ISS PRICE 99.369  FIRST PAY DATE 9/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 7.34 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD 76 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>AMT $50 MLN	  COUPON 7.79 PCT   MATURITY 3/1/2017</p>
<p>TYPE BONDS	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 9/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 7.79 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD 91 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
